### Rebuild index
< {%
    request.variables.set("reason", "manual")
%}
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/rebuild
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Watch orders
WEBSOCKET ws://stream.staging.acme.example.test/orders

### Stream calls
GRPC stream.staging.acme.example.test:443/acme.Orders/Watch

### Orders by status
GRAPHQL {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

query ($status: String!) {
  orders(status: $status) { id total }
}

{ "status": "{{status}}" }

### Orders by status (VS Code)
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Type: GraphQL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

query { orders { id } }

### Random number
GET {{baseUrl}}/random/{{$random.integer(1, 10)}}

### Chained
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{login.response.body.$.orderId}}

### Other host
GET https://api.other.example.test/orders

### Digest status
GET {{baseUrl}}/status
Authorization: Digest {{serviceUser}} {{servicePassword}}
